Package: sx1255-multimode
Architecture: arm64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, systemd
Description: multimode SX1255 radio framework (FM/D-Star/M17)
 sx1255-multimode is a modular hotspot/repeater framework for the
 SX1255 HAT on Raspberry Pi Zero 2 W. One RF frontend, one shared IQ
 stream, and FM (CTCSS), D-Star and M17 as independent plugins, plus
 spectrum/waterfall web dashboard, IQ capture/replay, watchdog and
 automatic capture.
